<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-007" chapter-id="c-jinshu-007-jin098-huanwen-opening" source-id="s-jinshu-007-jin098-huanwen-opening">
  <p id="c-jinshu-007-jin098-huanwen-opening:defence" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">六月，<persName id="c-jinshu-007-jin098-huanwen-opening:defence:m0003" ref="af7_a2c_011">韓晃</persName>攻宣城，內史<persName id="c-jinshu-007-jin098-huanwen-opening:defence:m0011" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_A">桓彝</persName>力戰，死之。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-007-jin098-huanwen-opening:linhuai" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">以輔國將軍、琅邪內史<persName id="c-jinshu-007-jin098-huanwen-opening:linhuai:m0010" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓溫</persName>爲前鋒小督、假節，帥衆入臨淮，安西將軍<persName id="c-jinshu-007-jin098-huanwen-opening:linhuai:m0031" ref="4qr_wrk_3vd_F">庾翼</persName>爲征討大都督，遷鎮襄陽。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-007-jin098-huanwen-opening:xuzhou" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">以琅邪內史<persName id="c-jinshu-007-jin098-huanwen-opening:xuzhou:m0005" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓溫</persName>都督青徐兗三州諸軍事、徐州刺史，</p>
</text>
